This is First Person Dungeon Crawler game written in Lua using the Love2D framework
In Lua function finish with the end keyword and not with }
When adding new UI elements that need callbacks, do not forget to check if the main.lua file has the proper callbacks in place, if not, add it
Remember that if you are using a function/value from another file/module, you need to import it using thre require statement
Remember that you are using Lua, a language that do not have types and can have nil values, if you are not sure a value has been initialized, check for nil before using it in any operation
